@startuml 21_seq_rejected_report
title Rejected agent report - security invariants
actor "Agent or attacker" as Agent
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "Private PostgreSQL" as DB
Agent -> API : POST report + invalid/revoked token
API -> DB : Lookup ACTIVE host by token hash
DB --> API : Not found or lifecycle REVOKED
API --> Agent : HTTP 401 Unauthorized
note right of DB : No sample, process or heartbeat mutation.
Agent -> API : POST malformed report + valid ACTIVE token
API -> API : Payload schema validation fails
API --> Agent : HTTP 422 Invalid Request
note over API,DB : Never log raw tokens or pairing secrets.
@enduml
